# Skip-on-unchanged fingerprints for regenerate_all (local build bookkeeping, not a site artifact).
/reports/regeneration-state.json
/reports/.regeneration-state-*.tmp

# Session-local tooling state, including the persistent regeneration flock inode
# (never deploy, never commit; an existing lock file does not imply an active run).
/.docxology/
/HERDR.md

# graft's local graph cache — regenerable, not committed (run `graft build`).
/graft/
